<div class="page-header"><h1>Kitchen Cabinets in Oregon</h1><p>From Portland and the Willamette Valley to the booming high-desert market in Bend, Oregon homeowners and designers can spec the full Pinnacle Sales lineup — Shiloh, Eclipse, Aspect, Pronorm German Kitchens, and Vistora Closets — through independent local showrooms.</p></div>
