<Breadcrumbs items={breadcrumbs} />

<p>Oregon's kitchen market is led by Portland's strong remodel culture and a fast-growing Bend market, with steady demand in Eugene, Salem, and the coast. This guide covers the brands available and where to see them.</p>
<h2 id="find-a-kitchen-cabinet-showroom-near-you">Find a Kitchen Cabinet Showroom Near You</h2>
<p>Pinnacle Sales brands are sold through independent local showrooms across Oregon. Tell us your project and where you're located, and we'll connect you with the nearest authorized dealer.</p>
<p><a class="btn btn-outline" href="/contact">Find a Local Dealer</a></p>
<h2 id="premium-cabinetry-brands-available-in-oregon">Premium Cabinetry Brands Available in Oregon</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/shiloh-cabinetry">Shiloh Cabinetry</a></strong> — Custom paint and broad wood species for Oregon's transitional and Pacific-Northwest-modern kitchens.</li>
