  <li><strong><a href="/brands/aspect-cabinetry">Aspect Cabinetry</a></strong> — Value semi-custom for residential and builder projects.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/pronorm-german-kitchens">Pronorm German Kitchens</a></strong> — Handleless European kitchens for high-end Portland and resort homes.</li>
