</ul>
<h2 id="oregon-kitchen-design-trends">Oregon Kitchen Design Trends</h2>
<p>Oregon kitchens lean Pacific-Northwest modern: natural wood tones, warm neutrals, matte finishes, and a clean, understated aesthetic that pairs well with the region's emphasis on natural materials and sustainability. Portland's remodel market favors transitional-to-modern work — two-tone schemes and <a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry">frameless</a> construction — while Bend's growth brings mountain-modern warmth with <a href="/brands/shiloh-cabinetry">Shiloh's</a> stain and paint program and handleless contemporary fronts at the high end.</p>
